//> 13:12: proved index out of bounds in search
//> 13:33: proved integer overflow in search
//> 15:23: proved index out of bounds in search
//> 21:8: proved integer overflow in middle
//> 21:5: proved index out of bounds in middle
//> 21:29: proved index out of bounds in middle
//> 28:5: proved integer overflow in digit
//> 40:13: proved integer overflow in even_part
//> 40:9: proved integer overflow in even_part
//> 40:5: proved index out of bounds in even_part
//> 48:5: kept index out of bounds in ratio (div), known 0..=2^63 - 1
